Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:49.44,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:51.44,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.44,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:03.35,memories,,0,0,0,,Here in Jeonbugwan we record all the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:06.69,memories,,0,0,0,,There is one that appeared on your birthday. Do you want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.44,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes, dad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:10.86,memories,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:24.66,memories,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.21,voiceover,,0,0,0,,My father studied the stars and took notes about them
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:34.67,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Because he was a magician who reads the constellations
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:48.98,memories,,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:50.23,memories,,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.45,memories,,0,0,0,,Stay here and don’t leave
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:06.62,memories,,0,0,0,,When you see your father, run
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:08.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t let him catch you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:34.48,memories,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:33.33,memories,,0,0,0,,I will give you strength
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:47.51,voiceover,,0,0,0,,The day my father was killed by the four Daeho families,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:50.06,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I followed Jin Moo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:53.94,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I was raised completely cut off from the world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:56.82,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,in the deep and dangerous valleys of Danhyanggok
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.56,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I don’t know, I survived because I’m strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:32.85,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,or strong because she survived
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:40.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,,When my past and my father were forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:43.65,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'm finally back as Naxu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.83,offscreen,,0,0,0,,But Naxu is dead
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.75,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I came back here as Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.17,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,with a helpless owner,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:02.38,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,who at the same time is my disinterested student
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.80,general text,,0,0,0,,How much longer do we have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.18,general text,,0,0,0,,This bracelet weighs a ton
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, your student is tired
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:11.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I've had enough. I can't go anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:13.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m carrying all the things!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the master, and you are my servant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This is your job
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:19.23,general text,,0,0,0,,When necessary, I am your teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.53,general text,,0,0,0,,and maid, when do you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:22.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:28.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:31.28,general text,,0,0,0,,that there is such a place outside the city
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:35.08,general text,,0,0,0,,This place is so harsh that you can’t even hear an echo here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Hence the name, Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,And I hear an echo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:45.51,general text,,0,0,0,,It's just a figure of speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:47.01,general text,,0,0,0,,The title is moronic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:53.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I lived over there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You will eat what I bring
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:59.48,general text,,0,0,0,,and sleep where you fall asleep after a hard day
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.19,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this? Smells like chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:08.78,general text,,0,0,0,,- Do they sell chickens here?\N- Who will sell chickens here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You feel it too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure. I love chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:21.21,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone is frying chicken nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:25.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Get down. Why did you go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.10,italics,,0,0,0,,See? Chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:39.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you it smells like her. How cool it is here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is all this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:03.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.59,general text,,0,0,0,,There’s even a bathtub here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:16.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:21.23,general text,,0,0,0,,there is a mountain of food and even a place to swim
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, you had a good home
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:25.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Was it really necessary to scare the student like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.73,general text,,0,0,0,,So strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:30.49,general text,,0,0,0,,And there is a blanket
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:35.03,general text,,0,0,0,,To put it mildly. Cute and comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.33,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not mine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone lives here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:50.63,general text,,0,0,0,,shall we eat chicken? She's already well prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:51.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:21.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:25.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Calm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:38.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Good boy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:40.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Well trained. Do you live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.77,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not a stray dog
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:45.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, fluffy, bring your master
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:52.03,general text,,0,0,0,,What a smart dog
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:55.70,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:57.24,voiceover,,0,0,0,,These can’t be Dan Zhu’s people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:00.58,offscreen,,0,0,0,,This one is not trying to hide or hide
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.33,italics,,0,0,0,,Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:07.46,general text,,0,0,0,,We are guests, so we can have a cup, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:10.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Watch what you eat and drink
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:13.05,general text,,0,0,0,,First we need to check who lives here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we’ll decide what to do next
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:16.26,general text,,0,0,0,,So you really don’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:17.72,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.10,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a dog, flowers everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.10,general text,,0,0,0,,chicken and tea is boiling
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.48,general text,,0,0,0,,And I was almost mistaken
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:24.93,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:28.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided that you are trying to kidnap me and live with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.86,general text,,0,0,0,,hiding behind training
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.73,general text,,0,0,0,,If this dog wagged its tail in front of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I would decide that this is all your plan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:36.65,general text,,0,0,0,,There's enough room for two or three kids
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything was different here when I lived here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:41.20,general text,,0,0,0,,The place was lifeless
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.87,general text,,0,0,0,,and was ideal for training, that's why I brought you here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:46.75,general text,,0,0,0,,So, training?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:49.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Only this was in your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget it! Eat and drink what you want, go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:53.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Let them kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:56.47,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:10:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t think she would react like that to a simple joke
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:03.47,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s my own fault for following her into this wilderness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.02,general text,,0,0,0,,No words
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.57,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Remain a clueless heir
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:19.78,memories,,0,0,0,,Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:22.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I’d rather stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:25.66,general text,,0,0,0,,how will I live like this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:13.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Today is the head of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.75,general text,,0,0,0,,convened the magicians of Deho at the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:20.76,general text,,0,0,0,,All 11 families are present except Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:24.76,general text,,0,0,0,,My fight with Chan Wook is such a big event?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:27.77,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a duel between magicians and the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:29.64,general text,,0,0,0,,The last one was hundreds of years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:32.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to punish Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:34.44,general text,,0,0,0,,for looking down on me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.90,general text,,0,0,0,,These are not personal scores
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:39.53,general text,,0,0,0,,His Majesty gave the order and the magicians gathered
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:43.28,general text,,0,0,0,,If they agree, an official duel will take place
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.58,general text,,0,0,0,,A gap has appeared that has destroyed stability and peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.87,general text,,0,0,0,,existed between the palace and the magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:08.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really agree with the decision to deprive Wook of his rights to become the next Gwangju?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:10.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, true
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Duel only
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:19.40,general text,,0,0,0,,will resolve the misunderstanding between the Crown Prince and Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:20.74,general text,,0,0,0,,And regarding Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:26.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I already have a candidate that I want to nominate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Escape is not equal to defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:32.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard he ran away before the fight was announced
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:36.00,general text,,0,0,0,,What a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:39.50,general text,,0,0,0,,He must fight honestly and die with dignity, like a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook didn’t have the guts for this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:46.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone here was his teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.89,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- He was never distinguished by talent
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:52.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I am against magicians being disgraced like that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.23,general text,,0,0,0,,What if we deprive Chan Wook of his magician status?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.99,general text,,0,0,0,,If we unanimously deprive him of this status,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:05.32,general text,,0,0,0,,you will have to take all his energy, he will lose his powers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you proposing to ruin a young man’s whole life?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:10.03,general text,,0,0,0,,But this will help deal with the fight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:15.21,italics,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the gate of his energy was closed because of his father
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.21,general text,,0,0,0,,- He’s right\N- There is a point
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:19.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Each of you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.59,general text,,0,0,0,,was Uka’s teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.34,general text,,0,0,0,,How can you talk so carelessly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:30.56,general text,,0,0,0,,about the destruction of the life of someone who was once your student?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:35.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor accepted the terms of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:38.69,general text,,0,0,0,,We will take upon ourselves the shame that may or may not fall
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:42.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Then let this be an official duel between Sosnovy Bor and the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:45.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:49.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard Uk mastered Ryusu in a very short time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:53.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Did someone from the forest teach him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:14:00.63,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter where he goes, to whom,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:05.92,general text,,0,0,0,,there is no teacher for him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:12.97,general text,,0,0,0,,The water is pleasant and clean. Skin has become softer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe it’s mineral
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:18.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, the owner of the house is a very neat person
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t think he’ll come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Sleeping soundly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Of course you're tired
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,We could have walked calmly, but you were in a hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You are now Moo Dok, not Nak Soo. You don't have enough strength
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.22,general text,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:57.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:58.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Fool
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:15:01.69,general text,,0,0,0,,If it was so hard, you should ask for help
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:11.03,general text,,0,0,0,,So soft
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the owner,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:21.75,general text,,0,0,0,,and she is a servant. That's right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:24.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I should sleep here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:40.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Somehow I’m uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:07.17,general text,,0,0,0,,good night
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:33.40,general text,,0,0,0,,How inconvenient
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.23,general text,,0,0,0,,You say there’s a nomad inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.48,general text,,0,0,0,,How interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Without your help, I would not have recognized her,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.22,general text,,0,0,0,,because there is no malice in her soul
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:50.15,general text,,0,0,0,,It is better for you to die at my hands than to go wild and petrify
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:20.76,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,There is an amazing soul in this body
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:26.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She should have gone wild by now, considering how weak this body is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:28.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Why is she still okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:40.16,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I don’t feel any energy. Where did she all disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:51.46,general text,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Get away from Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:31.39,general text,,0,0,0,,This sword was given by the king of Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:36.11,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing next to such a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:41.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.45,0:22:10.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Finally woke up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:17.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Yesterday's Man
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:20.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Yesterday’s man?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.63,0:22:21.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:27.84,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.09,0:23:05.88,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw someone in the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:10.89,general text,,0,0,0,,and you suddenly pulled out a sword, I had no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:12.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was scared myself
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.39,0:23:14.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I still have poor control of the energy in my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:16.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:18.14,general text,,0,0,0,,You two...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:20.02,general text,,0,0,0,,fought?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:26.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You really don’t remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:28.61,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.69,0:23:31.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You were standing right there and looking at us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:32.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:33.53,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:35.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you're sleepwalking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I will give you medicinal herbs for this. Brew tea and drink
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.21,0:23:41.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you a healer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:43.83,general text,,0,0,0,,No, but he is here to collect some herbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.54,general text,,0,0,0,,which can only be found here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Call me Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:49.30,general text,,0,0,0,,There is enough space for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.38,0:23:51.26,general text,,0,0,0,,make yourself at home
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:56.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sapsari
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.47,0:23:59.85,italics,,0,0,0,,You really don’t remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:01.94,italics,,0,0,0,,Did I really walk in my sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.95,0:24:17.20,italics,,0,0,0,,I was lying on the floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:19.75,general text,,0,0,0,,This nomad is special
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.83,0:24:23.04,general text,,0,0,0,,A special soul in such a weak body
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:27.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's get to know her better
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:28.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t lie
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Seriously! I shifted you so that you can sleep more comfortably
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.59,0:24:32.97,general text,,0,0,0,,What is your relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:35.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Married?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.01,0:24:37.22,general text,,0,0,0,,- No\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.18,0:24:41.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t sleep on the bed. I was lying on the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.43,0:24:43.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should I lie? I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:44.85,italics,,0,0,0,,- You always lie\N{\i0}- Surely married
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.77,0:24:46.94,general text,,0,0,0,,- Not at all\N- Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, did you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.19,0:24:50.73,general text,,0,0,0,,No, lost. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:52.99,general text,,0,0,0,,He is very strong
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.07,0:24:55.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- He...\N- You're lucky. I knew it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:56.41,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.74,0:25:04.12,general text,,0,0,0,,They even gathered a council. Things are getting complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.21,0:25:07.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think Wook and Moo Deok are okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.63,0:25:10.30,general text,,0,0,0,,They went to Sari, the home village of Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:11.55,general text,,0,0,0,,She’s happy, I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:14.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should she be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.05,0:25:16.18,general text,,0,0,0,,She had to leave you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.26,0:25:18.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- And?\N - Well, you’re an idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:20.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok is in love with you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.14,0:25:24.52,general text,,0,0,0,,She said so,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.44,0:25:26.77,general text,,0,0,0,,to help Uku
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.85,0:25:28.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.57,0:25:34.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard Mr. Chan ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.57,0:25:38.70,general text,,0,0,0,,He didn’t run away, he just hid for now
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:40.24,general text,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.33,0:25:43.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So he went to Danhyangok with Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.87,0:25:46.96,general text,,0,0,0,,- Danhyangok?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.04,0:25:50.42,general text,,0,0,0,,She recently set off fireworks there on the orders of the master
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.50,0:25:53.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I remember seeing them
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.17,0:25:56.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I found out that they went there because it was close
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:59.01,general text,,0,0,0,,- Am I right?\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:01.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok with Uk in the village of Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.06,0:26:04.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:06.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell anyone that Uk is there
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.85,0:26:08.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, I won’t say
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Bon appetit
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:14.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok in Danhyangok?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:15.82,general text,,0,0,0,,The place is very dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:18.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you keep your bird there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:20.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You twisted your ankle there and scared everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.95,0:26:23.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.54,0:26:27.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I forgot all about this place
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.39,0:26:42.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Weak fire
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:50.19,general text,,0,0,0,,His body is full of energy, considering his strength
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.19,0:26:54.90,general text,,0,0,0,,He is the master of Chipsu
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.53,0:26:57.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Chips? So he's as strong as me
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.99,0:27:00.36,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s clear why it was so hard to beat him
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.92,0:27:12.08,italics,,0,0,0,,He uses energy to keep the fire going
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:13.25,general text,,0,0,0,,He has moved on,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.17,0:27:15.30,general text,,0,0,0,,than Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.01,0:27:18.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Ryusu?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:22.72,general text,,0,0,0,,He is stronger than me. I could have gotten hurt a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,The rain wet my clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.83,0:27:53.00,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.79,0:27:55.71,general text,,0,0,0,,He dried his clothes so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:58.42,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the highest degree of Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.22,0:28:06.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Highest degree?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:09.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I could have died
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:14.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Now it’s dry
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:25.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t drink this tea
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:31.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you drunk everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.46,0:28:32.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:34.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Does anything hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:38.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this a poisonous decoction?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:40.59,italics,,0,0,0,,No, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.67,0:28:41.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Broth decoction
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.05,0:28:43.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Prutnyak?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.38,0:28:44.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Twig decoction?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.22,0:28:48.26,general text,,0,0,0,,You talked about herbs that grow only in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:49.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you talking about twigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.98,0:28:53.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:56.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that magicians drank this kind of tea...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.94,0:29:00.28,general text,,0,0,0,,He lowered libido and they calmly trained
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.69,0:29:03.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Libido? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.20,0:29:06.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Carnal desire, one of the five human needs
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.07,0:29:08.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Carnal...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.29,0:29:13.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Prutnyak lowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.87,0:29:18.09,general text,,0,0,0,,energy that causes this desire
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.30,0:29:23.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard about a magician who reached a high level of witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.17,0:29:25.80,general text,,0,0,0,,He succeeded because he lowered his libido and improved
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.88,0:29:29.05,italics,,0,0,0,,They say he only wears clothes made of hemp fabric,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:32.35,general text,,0,0,0,,that’s why Master Li was nicknamed “Master Hemp Li”
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.43,0:29:36.14,general text,,0,0,0,,And you are smart for a simple servant
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.77,0:29:41.98,general text,,0,0,0,,It is an honor for me to meet a magician of such a level
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.53,0:29:44.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Master HempLi
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:54.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Host,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.16,0:29:56.08,general text,,0,0,0,,why are you sitting? Say hello
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.21,0:30:02.50,general text,,0,0,0,,So... my libido is already quite the same?..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.88,0:30:05.01,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:06.09,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.17,0:30:07.72,general text,,0,0,0,,But not this...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.35,general text,,0,0,0,,This cannot be. Help me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.18,0:30:13.93,general text,,0,0,0,,One kettle is not enough for this
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:15.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:17.94,italics,,0,0,0,,It's true. If you're so worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.02,0:30:20.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll brew another tea that will put everything back in place
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:25.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:26.15,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.24,0:30:28.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you help my master?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:33.45,general text,,0,0,0,,His energy has accumulated in his right hand and he cannot control it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.54,0:30:37.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you teach him how to cope somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.54,0:30:39.21,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t be difficult to teach him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.29,0:30:42.25,general text,,0,0,0,,But! To learn from me you have to follow everything I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.34,0:30:43.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.63,0:30:45.05,italics,,0,0,0,,He is ready for anything
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.13,0:30:46.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.59,0:30:51.35,general text,,0,0,0,,What exactly do I need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.43,0:30:52.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Like me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.77,general text,,0,0,0,,drink a decoction of twigs
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.06,0:30:58.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Ready to downgrade
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:02.23,general text,,0,0,0,,libido?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.82,0:31:08.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you emptied the whole kettle?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.95,0:31:09.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:12.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.30,general text,,0,0,0,,So what if he’s a famous magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:30.09,general text,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t have a student, and he’s hanging around here for no apparent reason
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.93,0:31:33.18,general text,,0,0,0,,With its help, everything will go faster
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:36.43,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be able to control the energy in your right hand
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.52,0:31:40.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, he wants me to drink this chastity tea. What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.19,0:31:44.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m already worried about how much I drank yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.73,0:31:47.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I doubt that this tea will be enough to bring everything back
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.23,0:31:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,This makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.20,0:31:52.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Not such a bad idea
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:55.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you don’t need increased libido
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.71,0:32:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So, for some time I won’t have any desires?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.96,0:32:06.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, look me in the eyes and tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.05,0:32:08.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes! And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:10.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Think for yourself. This is a rare opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.67,0:32:12.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Not every fool is lucky enough to meet someone like him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.55,general text,,0,0,0,,A little restraint
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:17.60,general text,,0,0,0,,and get rid of it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.68,0:32:20.18,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not a walk in the garden, don’t bother me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.27,0:32:22.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Celibacy is an insignificant sacrifice for a high-level magician
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.39,0:32:24.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Just listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.27,0:32:26.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t care even if I ruin everything for myself there forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.82,0:32:28.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop making mountains out of molehills!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.36,0:32:30.40,general text,,0,0,0,,It is important to me, regardless of whether I use it or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:43.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.25,0:32:45.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey Moo Deok, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.54,0:32:48.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.63,0:32:50.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:55.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Energy leaked out of you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.76,0:32:59.18,general text,,0,0,0,,A little energy and such a surge of power
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.77,0:33:02.81,general text,,0,0,0,,If you took off the bracelet and used all your strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.89,0:33:04.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I would die on the spot
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:09.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're bleeding...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.32,0:33:14.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, you are completely crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:16.41,general text,,0,0,0,,- Do you like the idea that I could die?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.49,0:33:19.41,general text,,0,0,0,,This means that you are becoming stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.00,0:33:26.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Now this may seem insignificant,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:29.67,general text,,0,0,0,,but soon you will have more energy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:33.84,general text,,0,0,0,,and your strength will become as impressive as Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.97,0:33:38.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I too can restore my strength
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.28,0:33:55.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Wipe the blood from your forehead before it floods Gyeongjeongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.78,0:33:59.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.70,0:34:01.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.41,0:34:02.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop being brave
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:09.71,general text,,0,0,0,,The first year of the reign of King Go San
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.79,0:34:12.17,general text,,0,0,0,,April Day
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.72,0:34:20.05,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Go San, year one, April 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:23.60,memories italics,,0,0,0,,The Star of the King lit up in the night sky on the boy’s birthday
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.68,0:34:26.31,memories,,0,0,0,,No one should know about this
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.39,0:34:28.90,memories,,0,0,0,,But Jeongbugwan probably made a recording
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.98,0:34:31.31,memories,,0,0,0,,I took the real sign out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.40,0:34:32.73,memories,,0,0,0,,In Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.86,0:34:35.49,memories,,0,0,0,,fake without star
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:41.32,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t let anyone know the secret of his birth
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.95,0:34:48.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Saw a strange constellation?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.42,0:35:01.51,general text,,0,0,0,,It's Wook's birthday and Lady Do Hwa's death
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.26,0:35:05.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard about the advice
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.89,0:35:11.44,general text,,0,0,0,,All the honorable magicians have gathered because of me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.23,0:35:15.53,italics,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.32,0:35:18.15,italics,,0,0,0,,why don’t you start your genealogy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.20,0:35:21.99,general text,,0,0,0,,By single vote,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.07,0:35:26.66,general text,,0,0,0,,you too may be recognized as a venerable magician
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.37,0:35:32.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I am from the Jin clan. Jinyeowon is the place where I was born
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.84,0:35:37.71,general text,,0,0,0,,What brought you to Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:39.30,general text,,0,0,0,,The nomad who was found in Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.38,0:35:41.59,general text,,0,0,0,,was an astrologer from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:44.76,general text,,0,0,0,,The magicians of Chongjingak began an investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.47,0:35:46.68,general text,,0,0,0,,provide assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.39,0:35:49.35,general text,,0,0,0,,What investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.11,0:35:58.03,general text,,0,0,0,,And if I tell you, will you hide all the evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.07,0:36:03.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to hide
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:05.58,general text,,0,0,0,,They can come at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.95,0:36:09.66,general text,,0,0,0,,They are already here
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.15,0:36:35.94,general text,,0,0,0,,This magician should have
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.02,0:36:38.98,general text,,0,0,0,,constantly maintain the required amount of energy here
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:42.70,general text,,0,0,0,,He was responsible for this place
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.45,0:36:54.67,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Body in Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.75,0:36:57.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim extracted all his energy, body in a secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.73,0:37:15.10,general text,,0,0,0,,There was nothing special in his work
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.19,0:37:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Just a remark for secretly looking at the constellation signs
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.65,0:37:22.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.78,0:37:27.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Many scientists have disappeared here
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.24,0:37:28.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Where could they have disappeared to?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.37,0:37:37.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.67,0:37:39.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing special
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.17,0:37:41.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I have one more request
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.30,0:37:43.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:48.26,general text,,0,0,0,,but I would like to take a look at Jeonbugwan's secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.03,0:38:07.91,general text,,0,0,0,,You can look around
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.27,0:38:36.98,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Carry the body through the underground passage
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.20,0:38:52.12,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If they hide something, they will try to get rid of it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.95,0:38:54.58,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Watch his people
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.67,0:38:59.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Faster
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.26,0:39:15.18,general text,,0,0,0,,We saw how this cart left Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.27,0:39:17.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you magicians?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.14,0:39:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Show faces
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.35,0:39:19.56,general text,,0,0,0,,We want to see what's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.19,0:40:04.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's get him
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.20,0:40:53.74,general text,,0,0,0,,The man ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.11,0:40:56.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.87,0:41:00.16,general text,,0,0,0,,This was inside
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.79,0:41:02.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Spirit Amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Are they from Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.68,0:41:23.89,general text,,0,0,0,,There was a spirit amulet in the cart
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.98,0:41:26.06,general text,,0,0,0,,No questions should arise
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.06,0:41:29.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su helped us even after death
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.15,0:41:36.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the difficulties, Deputy Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.91,0:41:43.75,general text,,0,0,0,,You attacked a man in the middle of the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.83,0:41:46.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I transferred your worthless soul to a worthy body,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.75,0:41:48.13,general text,,0,0,0,,but you had no right to show off
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.21,0:41:49.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.05,0:42:00.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Deliver this chest
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.31,0:42:05.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Make sure it's in the right hands
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.56,0:42:08.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it right away
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.49,0:42:21.41,general text,,0,0,0,,It's time to get rid of him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.49,0:42:23.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Find me another eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.29,0:42:27.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Or I will move your soul into his body
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.38,0:42:32.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Into the body of a eunuch?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.96,0:42:35.72,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Don't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.55,0:42:40.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I will follow your order
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.93,0:42:44.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you still carrying the Reflector with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.10,0:42:45.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.65,0:42:57.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about refraining from transmigrating souls because of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.82,0:43:02.99,general text,,0,0,0,,But, apparently, this is the only way to serve His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.71,0:43:12.09,italics,,0,0,0,,The Sosnovy Bor amulet was found in a strange cart,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.17,0:43:14.25,general text,,0,0,0,,which left Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.34,0:43:17.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Now we have no right to look for anything there
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.30,0:43:20.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Find out whose amulet this is
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.76,0:43:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Remember, Uk lost his
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.31,0:43:28.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And judging by this burnt mark, this is his amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.10,0:43:31.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Uka's amulet?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.48,0:43:35.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Just think, he escaped, but problems still fall on us
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.69,0:43:37.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Find Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.53,0:43:41.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Find out how and where he lost it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:43.57,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:26.70,general text,,0,0,0,,This is from Jin Moo, Jeonbugwan's deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.67,0:44:39.80,general text,,0,0,0,,What does he keep sending you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.55,0:44:43.84,general text,,0,0,0,,These are medicinal herbs for my health
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.85,0:44:49.14,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t tell from him, but he’s very caring
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.11,0:45:05.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.11,0:45:07.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I will go with Master Li to collect herbs
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.78,0:45:08.83,general text,,0,0,0,,And training?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.91,0:45:11.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to pay for the content. See you later
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.91,0:45:13.29,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.37,0:45:15.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it really so beautiful there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.04,0:45:18.84,general text,,0,0,0,,- Simply amazing\N- I wish I could see it soon
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.18,0:45:26.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, you are so clever
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.64,0:45:29.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I buy everything and add it up. Hold it
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.51,0:45:30.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.89,0:45:36.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.65,0:45:41.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Today we will go where there are a lot of tangerines*
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.65,0:45:41.36,notes,,0,0,0,,*Chinese snapper
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.44,0:45:44.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Tangerines? Let's take what we need and prepare fish stew
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.78,0:45:46.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.20,0:45:48.16,general text,,0,0,0,,No, but you will teach me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.08,0:45:50.91,general text,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.13,0:46:03.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Over salted
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.97,0:46:07.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, try
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.22,0:46:11.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, are you here to deal with nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.18,0:46:12.93,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.72,0:46:15.89,general text,,0,0,0,,There is something to learn from Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.98,0:46:17.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Who asks you to learn this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.48,0:46:19.48,general text,,0,0,0,,If you learn from him, learn correctly!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.31,0:46:22.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, I think I’m perfect for this kind of life
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.94,0:46:24.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.65,0:46:26.24,general text,,0,0,0,,to such a wonderful place
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.82,0:46:29.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re not worried
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.12,0:46:34.20,general text,,0,0,0,,because of the duel with the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.62,0:46:37.67,general text,,0,0,0,,If you’re so worried, figure it out yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.63,0:46:40.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Definitely oversalted
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.75,0:46:44.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.56,0:46:57.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, put down the knife
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.73,0:47:00.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare throw it at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.23,0:47:03.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I said I'll kill you if you're useless
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:05.57,general text,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.65,0:47:07.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I mastered Chipsu, and you are just Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.74,0:47:11.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You are not Nak Soo anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.12,0:47:15.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.50,0:47:19.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You and I don’t need peace and tranquility
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.42,0:47:20.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I will destroy your world
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.13,0:47:28.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.59,0:47:30.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you stopping me from living peacefully?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.80,0:47:32.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you happy with this kind of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.93,0:47:34.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.89,0:47:37.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Absolutely. If you don't like it, leave
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.89,0:47:39.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I like living here,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.89,0:47:42.86,general text,,0,0,0,,and you can leave if you are against it
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.19,0:47:46.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.57,0:47:49.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You know that we are connected by fate
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.28,0:47:52.53,general text,,0,0,0,,And you want me to finish everything
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.37,0:47:55.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Coward
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.90,0:48:28.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I found a way for Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.78,0:48:32.49,general text,,0,0,0,,avoid the duel and become the gwangju of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.49,0:48:36.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Which one? We are ready for anything
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.58,0:48:41.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him marry my daughter Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.59,0:48:52.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Our family has an amulet that will allow
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.13,0:48:53.97,general text,,0,0,0,,refuse the king's orders
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.06,0:49:01.64,general text,,0,0,0,,We can even overthrow the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.73,0:49:05.06,general text,,0,0,0,,if all Deho mages vote for this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.02,0:49:09.86,general text,,0,0,0,,This amulet was entrusted to us by the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.94,0:49:14.49,general text,,0,0,0,,to avoid the escape of the evil spirits that are sealed in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.07,0:49:19.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You propose to cancel the king’s order to deprive Uka of his rights
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.37,0:49:21.75,general text,,0,0,0,,be the next Gwangju?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.83,0:49:24.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, but only if he marries my daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.92,0:49:26.79,general text,,0,0,0,,and will join the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.59,0:49:34.30,general text,,0,0,0,,But Mrs. Jin and Mr. Wook once
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.43,0:49:38.30,general text,,0,0,0,,the engagement has already been broken. Is this not a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.72,0:49:41.93,general text,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t because my feelings for him had passed
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.60,0:49:45.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I still want to marry Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:51.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t think he would get married early
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.82,0:49:53.90,general text,,0,0,0,,And I’m not sure that he’s ready to get married
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.66,0:50:06.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You're doing well for a rich man's son
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.67,0:50:09.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Once I get excited about something, I learn quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.88,0:50:11.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I like you even more
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.76,0:50:15.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Reconsider your desire to become my student
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.38,0:50:19.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, didn’t you have a single student?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.14,0:50:22.89,general text,,0,0,0,,There was one,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.97,0:50:24.98,general text,,0,0,0,,but he gave up celibacy and got married
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.94,0:50:28.85,general text,,0,0,0,,He works in a hospital now
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.53,0:50:38.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You can change your mind and refuse at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.95,0:50:40.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.95,0:50:44.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t come here for training
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.29,0:50:46.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to spend this power
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.16,0:50:48.83,general text,,0,0,0,,fishing and collecting herbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.09,0:50:57.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- I still don’t control her\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.72,0:51:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,This hand will become a burden if you leave it like this
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.89,0:51:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to take all the energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.60,0:51:08.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you can live an ordinary life
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.70,0:51:26.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the city. Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.54,0:51:29.46,general text,,0,0,0,,No, not today. I have to cook Moo Deok to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.67,0:51:33.71,general text,,0,0,0,,She is not here. She recently went down the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.92,0:51:36.05,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.13,0:51:38.97,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook is just a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.05,0:51:41.34,italics,,0,0,0,,He has already mastered Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.43,0:51:44.01,general text,,0,0,0,,and is training hard for the fight
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.14,0:51:48.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Let such a rumor spread around the city
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.64,0:51:49.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.39,0:51:53.15,general text,,0,0,0,,If he doesn’t appear, he’ll completely lose face
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.19,0:51:57.32,general text,,0,0,0,,So at least he will feel humiliated
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.03,0:51:59.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me some chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.36,0:52:01.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Leave today. Here are the people of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.03,0:52:03.99,italics,,0,0,0,,Someone important came today
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.08,0:52:06.79,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s better not to intersect with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.87,0:52:08.41,general text,,0,0,0,,especially after the story with the amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.39,0:52:30.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.44,0:52:37.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you Chan Wook’s maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.78,0:52:40.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.36,0:52:44.78,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Nak Soo would never transfer her soul into such a body
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.95,0:52:46.99,italics,,0,0,0,,Hey you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.66,0:52:51.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when we met in the inn by the pier?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.05,0:53:02.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t even know
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.97,0:53:08.26,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He suspects me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.39,0:53:12.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you a couple of questions. Come with us to Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.77,0:53:16.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.90,0:53:18.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let me go\N- Stand still
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.07,0:53:20.48,general text,,0,0,0,,- Why are you...\N- Well, stand still
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.90,0:53:24.03,offscreen,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have a blue mark
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.57,0:53:27.45,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She’s right, isn’t Nak Soo?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.37,0:53:32.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know where the master is
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.13,0:53:37.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.21,0:53:42.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.55,0:53:45.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.30,0:53:46.68,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s me, Won Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.31,0:54:00.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You are Won Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.82,0:54:04.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, it’s me. You gave me this name
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.32,0:54:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Won Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.07,0:54:10.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please help me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.03,0:54:12.16,general text,,0,0,0,,With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.75,0:54:15.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you are not just smart, but also very strong
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.96,0:54:18.21,general text,,0,0,0,,And my master, on the contrary, is stupid and pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.29,0:54:20.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Because of him, my life is in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.17,0:54:21.92,italics,,0,0,0,,Please help me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.43,0:54:30.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.06,0:54:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,What does your stupid and pathetic master do?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.98,0:54:38.19,general text,,0,0,0,,He just cries every day
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.27,0:54:41.32,general text,,0,0,0,,He is so afraid of you that he is shaking with fear
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.40,0:54:43.15,general text,,0,0,0,,and cries in secret
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.94,0:54:46.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I see that you speak badly of him to please me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.74,0:54:51.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I can say worse things if it makes you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.41,0:54:56.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Moo Deok, you must think I'm pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.58,0:54:58.50,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t give me this name for nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.08,0:55:02.38,general text,,0,0,0,,You can tell me everything you wanted, but couldn’t,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.46,0:55:04.21,general text,,0,0,0,,because they were afraid to seem pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.38,0:55:07.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be a verbal cesspool?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.76,0:55:10.51,general text,,0,0,0,,This is too high a title for me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.59,0:55:12.39,general text,,0,0,0,,But it would be an honor for me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.47,0:55:16.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need you to relieve tension
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.48,0:55:21.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you have already done enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.56,0:55:24.98,general text,,0,0,0,,but couldn’t you order those people not to take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.65,0:55:27.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Warning will be enough
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.04,0:55:36.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.83,0:55:39.04,italics,,0,0,0,,This is my sachet
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.12,0:55:40.29,notes,,0,0,0,,Sachet - a paper or fabric pad (bag) with loose fragrant filling
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.37,0:55:43.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Show this if your pathetic master gets you into trouble again
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.63,0:55:47.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.97,0:55:54.81,general text,,0,0,0,,He smells like cinnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.89,0:55:56.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you have such a face?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.77,0:55:58.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Don't you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.93,0:56:01.48,general text,,0,0,0,,No, I really like it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.19,0:56:03.69,general text,,0,0,0,,- If you don’t like it, return it {\i1}\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.77,0:56:05.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ve already soiled it with myself
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.15,0:56:09.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I thank you for this wonderful smelling gift
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.78,0:56:14.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me pour you a drink that smells just as good
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.17,0:56:26.59,italics,,0,0,0,,This is wine with cinnamon and ginger
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.67,0:56:27.96,general text,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of cinnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.05,0:56:32.55,general text,,0,0,0,,You probably don’t like it. Return the sachet
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.18,0:56:34.18,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.26,0:56:35.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Like
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.56,0:56:47.86,general text,,0,0,0,,- Tasty?\N- Very
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.94,0:56:48.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Drink more
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.99,0:56:59.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok probably went to Chwisong-ru. She has nowhere else to go
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.41,0:57:02.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Did she get angry and leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.25,0:57:04.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of maid is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.50,0:57:07.13,general text,,0,0,0,,She's not just a servant
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:11.09,general text,,0,0,0,,If she is not just a servant, then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.01,0:57:14.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok is like an egg
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.51,0:57:16.14,general text,,0,0,0,,She must be protected
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.14,0:57:19.72,italics,,0,0,0,,- Let's go have a look\N- What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.81,0:57:21.93,italics,,0,0,0,,They found the corpse of a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.02,0:57:23.81,italics,,0,0,0,,- The corpse of a nomad?\N- Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.77,0:57:29.57,italics,,0,0,0,,- Let me take a look\N- What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.65,0:57:31.44,italics,,0,0,0,,- Holy Heaven\N- Horror
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.53,0:57:34.36,italics,,0,0,0,,Nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.28,0:57:40.29,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.37,0:57:42.29,general text,,0,0,0,,But he died because of him
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.00,0:57:44.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know about nomads?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.58,0:57:47.13,general text,,0,0,0,,When nomads lose their minds, they absorb the energy of people
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.71,0:57:49.67,general text,,0,0,0,,That is why the alchemy of souls was prohibited,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.75,0:57:52.13,general text,,0,0,0,,and the nomads began to be caught and killed
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.68,0:58:05.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Are all the nomads losing their minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.69,0:58:07.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Only those who do not speak Hwansu
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.65,0:58:11.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Can a person reach such a level?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.90,0:58:13.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.99,0:58:17.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to become my student and reach this level?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.86,0:58:20.49,general text,,0,0,0,,You are not only smart and well-built,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.58,0:58:22.45,general text,,0,0,0,,you have everything you need for this
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.37,0:58:26.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the compliment, but I don’t want to take a vow of celibacy
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.87,0:58:28.08,general text,,0,0,0,,If you become my student,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.17,0:58:30.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I will help you take off this bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.25,0:58:32.34,general text,,0,0,0,,"Teacher"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.92,0:58:34.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Repeat
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.67,0:58:37.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Please stop persuading me
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.18,0:58:40.68,italics,,0,0,0,,We are from Jeonbugwan, make way
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.81,0:58:45.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to go. I can't get in their sight
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.53,0:59:02.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Look there
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.37,0:59:03.91,italics,,0,0,0,,- Is this a rainbow?\N- Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.99,0:59:06.62,italics,,0,0,0,,It's a rainbow
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.71,0:59:09.04,italics,,0,0,0,,- It's really a rainbow\N- Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.12,0:59:12.21,italics,,0,0,0,,- Look\N- How long she’s been gone
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.38,0:59:14.76,italics,,0,0,0,,- Beauty\N- Take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.84,0:59:17.13,italics,,0,0,0,,- It really is a rainbow{\i0}\N- Where did the cart go?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.13,0:59:19.72,italics,,0,0,0,,She was here a minute ago
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.26,0:59:23.06,italics,,0,0,0,,- Where did she go?\N- Where is the cart?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.58,0:59:55.17,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s amazing to hear your echo in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.05,0:59:58.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.13,1:00:04.22,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Is Moo Deok drunk?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.30,1:00:06.35,general text,,0,0,0,,You say she was drinking here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.43,1:00:08.60,general text,,0,0,0,,They almost took her to Jeonbugwan today
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.56,1:00:12.56,general text,,0,0,0,,But, fortunately, the Crown Prince saved her
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.90,1:00:16.36,general text,,0,0,0,,- Crown Prince?{\i1}\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.44,1:00:18.15,general text,,0,0,0,,She was good at making him laugh
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.24,1:00:19.82,italics,,0,0,0,,She found an approach to him
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.90,1:00:22.82,general text,,0,0,0,,She drank all the glasses he offered her
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.04,1:00:28.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.77,1:00:59.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Drunk as hell
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.82,1:01:02.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.45,1:01:09.37,general text,,0,0,0,,My student, you have come for me
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.25,1:01:13.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I came for you, teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.04,1:01:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t control my body
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.38,1:01:20.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t even hold my head straight
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.01,1:01:24.13,general text,,0,0,0,,This never happened before, no matter how much I drank
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:27.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You are no longer a skilled warrior,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.93,1:01:30.10,general text,,0,0,0,,but just Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.36,1:01:39.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t even drink
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.25,1:02:03.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to leave everything and lead a quiet life
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.72,1:02:08.30,general text,,0,0,0,,But something bothers me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.79,1:02:37.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Thought I fell from a great height
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.08,1:02:40.96,general text,,0,0,0,,But I guess it wasn’t that high
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.51,1:02:51.93,memories,,0,0,0,,Looks like I broke my leg
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.51,1:02:53.72,memories,,0,0,0,,Help me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.47,1:02:58.31,memories,,0,0,0,,I saw you use this to call your bird
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.73,1:03:02.02,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I want to try it too
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.11,1:03:04.53,memories,,0,0,0,,Can I have it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.96,1:03:21.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to return it to you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.91,1:03:55.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.78,1:03:56.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.24,1:04:03.74,italics,,0,0,0,,She's really here
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.83,1:04:05.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Where is Uk?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:07.91,italics,,0,0,0,,I told you not to run
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.92,1:04:11.25,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.33,1:04:12.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.63,1:04:14.55,general text,,0,0,0,,We did not find you in the village of Sari,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.63,1:04:17.13,general text,,0,0,0,,so we came here to look for you
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.72,1:04:19.80,italics,,0,0,0,,Ju Wol was right, you are really here
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.88,1:04:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,How are you doing, Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.26,1:04:24.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.00,1:04:52.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, you're probably glad to see us
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.34,1:04:57.30,general text,,0,0,0,,She's drunk
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.42,1:05:00.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Did she drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.13,1:05:01.68,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes{\i1}\N- Saw
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.26,1:05:03.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Help her up
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.18,1:05:05.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Raise her
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.98,1:05:17.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok used to come to Danhyangk to collect medicinal herbs
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.48,1:05:20.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li lives here, he allowed us to stop here
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.78,1:05:23.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe Moo Deok got drunk alone
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.24,1:05:24.57,italics,,0,0,0,,She lives well
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.24,1:05:27.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know there was such a place in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.95,1:05:29.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you know about Danhyangok?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.41,1:05:31.58,general text,,0,0,0,,He used to come here often
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.66,1:05:34.54,general text,,0,0,0,,He got it for constantly running away
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.63,1:05:35.71,italics,,0,0,0,,Yul?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.21,1:05:38.34,italics,,0,0,0,,He was crazy about birds
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.42,1:05:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.97,1:05:42.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You even hurt your leg here
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.09,1:05:46.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I wanted to see them
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.43,1:05:53.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t care about the broken leg
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.40,1:05:56.23,general text,,0,0,0,,And I was not afraid that they would scold me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.65,1:06:01.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I loved them very much
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.67,1:06:19.13,italics,,0,0,0,,He really likes birds
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.96,1:06:22.76,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way, what kind of tea is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.84,1:06:25.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- The smell is very pleasant\N- Did you drink it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.93,1:06:30.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, but what? Is he useful?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.06,1:06:31.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.02,1:06:34.02,general text,,0,0,0,,It is made from medicinal herbs,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.10,1:06:36.52,general text,,0,0,0,,which grow only in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.60,1:06:37.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.77,1:06:39.86,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yul, try it too...\N- Don’t drink...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.36,1:06:41.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, help yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.48,1:06:43.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- The smell is really pleasant\N- Tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.20,1:06:47.78,general text,,0,0,0,,This is chastity tea
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.20,1:06:50.24,italics,,0,0,0,,What? Chastity?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.33,1:06:52.91,general text,,0,0,0,,You will not be able to...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.62,1:06:57.54,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is this buttercup tea?\N- I don’t know exactly
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.21,1:06:59.25,italics,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.34,1:07:02.26,general text,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of different herbs, you can drink
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.05,1:07:05.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Tasty
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.76,1:07:10.26,general text,,0,0,0,,To your health
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.46,1:07:43.67,general text,,0,0,0,,A bunch of suspicious men and my amulet?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.26,1:07:45.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.21,1:07:47.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Have you really lost your amulet?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.22,1:07:49.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Did someone steal it from you or did you lend it to someone?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.64,1:07:51.85,general text,,0,0,0,,No, I lost it
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.93,1:07:54.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember where and when this happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.31,1:07:57.14,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.23,1:07:59.73,general text,,0,0,0,,We found him when we were investigating the case of the nomads
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.81,1:08:01.65,general text,,0,0,0,,This is very important and dangerous
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.66,1:08:13.03,italics,,0,0,0,,Jin Jo Young and Chan Wook's wedding?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.62,1:08:16.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Wonderful idea
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.25,1:08:20.46,general text,,0,0,0,,But those who marry must love each other
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.54,1:08:24.25,general text,,0,0,0,,He cannot marry someone he doesn’t love just to solve the problem
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.34,1:08:28.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Who would talk about love! All my life I am like a lonely tree in a field. Both!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.09,1:08:31.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Wedding is no joke
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.89,1:08:33.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I also felt love
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.51,1:08:34.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.68,1:08:38.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I turned away from the master because of love
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.43,1:08:40.98,general text,,0,0,0,,And it was all in vain
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.06,1:08:42.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.98,1:08:43.94,general text,,0,0,0,,getting them married
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:51.11,general text,,0,0,0,,An unknown person destroyed our barrier and entered
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.83,1:08:59.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Ho Yeom, come out and say hello
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.37,1:09:03.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Who dares call me by name?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.96,1:09:09.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Yom
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.26,1:09:11.59,general text,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.64,1:09:13.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.39,1:09:15.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.14,1:09:17.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.72,1:09:19.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.81,1:09:21.77,general text,,0,0,0,,My teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.94,1:09:26.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Lower your swords! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.55,1:09:50.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.51,1:09:54.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Thought you were sleeping. Searched everywhere
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you still drunk?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.93,1:09:59.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Drunk thought I could climb on it
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.64,1:10:04.15,general text,,0,0,0,,But it’s high here. I think I'm coming to my senses
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.81,1:10:07.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that the tree with the nest on top?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.86,1:10:08.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.36,1:10:12.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to climb this tree again
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.78,1:10:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you really climb to the very top?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.41,1:10:20.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I was Nak Soo then
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.79,1:10:24.75,general text,,0,0,0,,The moon from there is simply incredible
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.00,1:10:28.29,general text,,0,0,0,,But I won’t see her again
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.42,1:10:32.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I ran into the man Dan Zhu today
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.17,1:10:34.68,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems he suspected me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.59,1:10:38.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you give them my spirit amulet?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.39,1:10:40.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I tried to use it to return
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.39,1:10:44.06,general text,,0,0,0,,But he killed the one he mistook for me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.06,1:10:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,If they catch me,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.02,1:10:51.36,general text,,0,0,0,,don’t try to save me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.40,1:10:55.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course. I'm too weak anyway
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.82,1:11:00.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Your student can’t do anything for you
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.12,1:11:05.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect anything
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.21,1:11:10.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:13.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t do much, but I can climb a tree
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.76,1:11:17.55,general text,,0,0,0,,There are no branches at the top to stand on
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.55,1:11:20.60,general text,,0,0,0,,We must use energy to create a foothold
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.22,1:11:23.68,general text,,0,0,0,,For this you need to master Chisa
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.31,1:11:26.02,general text,,0,0,0,,You care about this like the moon
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.10,1:11:27.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to do anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.69,1:11:30.52,general text,,0,0,0,,but I want to climb this tree
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.95,1:11:38.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to look at the moon from there
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.82,1:11:40.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can help with this,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.58,1:11:42.99,general text,,0,0,0,,so I'll try
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.04,1:11:45.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go up?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.71,1:11:50.67,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to master Chisa, I told you so
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.38,1:11:53.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want it or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.22,1:12:00.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Then help me
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.22,1:12:03.72,general text,,0,0,0,,go up there
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.73,1:12:06.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.06,1:12:10.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I will take you to the top of this tree
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.69,1:12:56.78,preview,,0,0,0,,How are you doing with Uka?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.86,1:12:59.53,preview,,0,0,0,,Do you know who my real father is?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.61,1:13:02.24,preview,,0,0,0,,No one expects you to fight him
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.32,1:13:05.45,preview,,0,0,0,,The next step may bring him closer to death
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.53,1:13:07.66,preview,,0,0,0,,Does your master know about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.75,1:13:10.83,preview,,0,0,0,,Did you meet Nak Soo as a child?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.92,1:13:12.29,preview,,0,0,0,,I don’t know her name or age
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.38,1:13:14.25,preview,,0,0,0,,Only the place from where we looked at the birds
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.34,1:13:15.88,preview,,0,0,0,,I don’t know where she lived
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:18.13,preview,,0,0,0,,The Jin family lives here
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.21,1:13:20.97,preview,,0,0,0,,Mistress Jin's daughter gets married
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.05,1:13:23.84,preview,,0,0,0,,What to do, teacher? Marry?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.93,1:13:26.64,preview,,0,0,0,,It is not my plan to be your maid forever

Comment: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Beta editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana
